+/**
+ * Evaluates pixels, if they are white, black or there is any unexpected result
+ * @param {gluDrawUtil.Surface} surface
+ * @param {number} minX
+ * @param {number} maxX
+ * @param {number} minY
+ * @param {number} maxY
+ * @return {boolean} True if tessellation is present
