+## File types that should never be checked ##
+
+*:*.pdf
+*:*.jpg
+*:*.png
+*:*.gif
+*:*.pdf
+*:*.wav
+*:*.mp3
+*:*.m4a
+*:*.oga
+*:*.ogv
+*:*.webm
+*:*.mp4
+*:*.m4v
+*:*.ttf
+*:*.woff
+*:*.eot
+*:*.sfd
+*:*.swf
